      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2015 SERAM. Published by Elsevier España, S.L.U. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We review the state of the art in imaging-guided percutaneous interventional procedures used to diagnose and/or treat the diverse causes of back pain. These procedures can be used for diagnosis, treatment, or both. They are focused on the vertebral bodies, the facet joints, the intervertebral discs, and the nerve structures."
